python-vici (6.0.1-1danos1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package strongSwan's VICI python bindings separately.
    Debian 13's strongswan 6.0.1 source builds every strongSwan binary package
    except python3-vici -- its debian/rules neither passes --enable-python-eggs
    nor installs the bindings. vyatta-security-vpn and vyatta-ike-sa-daemon
    both need them, so the bindings are packaged here, taken verbatim from the
    strongswan 6.0.1 release tarball. No upstream source is modified.

 -- DANOS Package Maintainers <DANOS@att.com>  Fri, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
